      "Cooperative groups and academic consortia (EORTC, BIG, GBG, ECOG-ACRIN) sponsor trials combining agents from different companies, as in many neoadjuvant breast cancer platform trials.",
      "The ICMJE requirement for data-sharing statements (2018) and the EU Clinical Trials Regulation increase disclosure of trial data.",
